<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak June PPI +0.2 pct mo/mo, +3.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak June PPI +0.2 pct mo/mo, +3.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak producer price index (PPI) rose 0.2 percent month-on-month, in June, putting prices 3.7 percent higher than in the same month of the previous year, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In May, PPI fell 0.6 percent, month-on-month, making the year-on-year increase 3.2 percent.  </p>
<p>  SLOVAK PRODUCER PRICES	June 97     May 97    June 96</p>
<p>  pct change mo/mo		 +0.2	  -0.6	 -0.3</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr		 +3.7	  +3.2	 +3.9</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
